<title>ESTONIA: SOCCER-ESTONIAN CHAMPIONSHIP RESULTS/STANDINGS.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-ESTONIAN CHAMPIONSHIP RESULTS/STANDINGS.</headline>
<dateline>TALLINN 1997-05-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results of Estonian soccer</p>
<p>championship matches:</p>
<p>Played on Tuesday</p>
<p> FC Flora   2   FC Marlekor  1</p>
<p> FC Lantana 3   Lelle Sk     0</p>
<p>    Standings:     P    W    D    L     F    A   Pts</p>
<p> 1. FC Flora	 7    6    1    0    21    6   34</p>
<p> 2. FC Lantana     6    5    0    1    18    5   33</p>
<p> 3. FC Marlekor    6    2    0    4     5   13   17</p>
<p> 4. Lelle SK	 7    2    0    5     3   15   17</p>
<p> 6. Tallinna Sadam 6    2    1    3     7    7   15</p>
<p> 5. Narva Trans    6    1    0    5     5   13   13</p>
<p>Note: Points totals include half the points won by clubs in</p>
<p>the Autumn season.</p>
